content.text:
a custom button still retains the default border width:
```
<button id="pendo-button-ff750287" type="button" class="bb-button _pendo-button-custom _pendo-button pendo-block-controls" data-editing-id="8c3d45c4-616b-4f2e-ab96-302f96601e50" style="border: 0px solid rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(31, 104, 166); font-weight: 400; border-radius: 0px; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0); background-image: none; display: block; position: relative; font-size: 14px; width: auto; float: none; vertical-align: baseline; padding: 0px; overflow: visible; text-align: center; font-family: inherit; white-space: pre-wrap; margin: 0px 5px 0px 0px; letter-spacing: 0px; line-height: 1; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-transform: none; min-width: 0px; animation: none;" aria-label="Informed Consent" role="link" data-_pendo-button-custom-1="" data-_pendo-button-3="">Informed Consent</button>
```
inherited from this rule:
```
@layer instui.button {
    :is(:scope,
    [class*=instui]) {
      & ._pendo-button {
        height:var(--fg)!important;
        min-height:var(--fg)!important;
        padding:var(--dl) var(--fh)!important;
        border-width:var(--h)!important;
        border-radius:var(--dd)!important;
        border-style:var(--de)!important;
        font-family:var(--df)!important;
        font-size:var(--ff)!important;
        font-weight:var(--dg)!important;
        line-height:var(--dj)!important;
        letter-spacing:var(--di)!important;
        cursor:pointer!important;
        margin:var(--pendo-space-0)!important;
        &:has(+._pendo-button) {
          margin-inline-end:var(--id)!important
        }
      }
    }
}
```

